  "prefLabel": "Emp 404.29 Termination from WorkNowNH",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Emp 404.29 Termination from WorkNowNH. In the event of a determination of fraud committed by a party in the program, funding and services shall be terminated and such party shall be ineligible for future participation and subject to either prosecution pursuant to RSA 282-A:161 or required to make restitution pursuant to RSA 282-A:164.\n\nSource. #13074, eff 7-22-20 (formerly Emp 404.28)",
